WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:09.760
Dear Jesus, may I enter into the eternal divine order of God

3
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:15.200
to place my absolute nothingness in the heart of the most holy trinity,

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.080
to give to my God the joy of fulfilling the purpose of my existence

5
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.960
by doing all the acts of my life through the immaculate heart of my mother Mary

6
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.240
and in the divine will of God. And in this same manner may I live,

7
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.960
pray, act, eat, walk, sleep, and do everything.

8
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:39.200
May my soul be devoid of any other longings, wants, or desires,

9
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.560
and may you my beloved divine will do with me whatever you want or desire.

10
00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.680
All I ask is that you bind me to your most holy will so intimately

11
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.480
that I may never swear from carrying out what I know to be your good pleasure

12
00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.280
and that I remain so docile to the movements of your divine will

13
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.520
that you never perceive even a breath of resistance

14
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.880
in my soul to your requests of me. Come divine will with all the angels and

15
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:13.600
saints, especially my sweet mother Mary, to touch my forehead,

16
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:18.000
to imprint on it the Holy Spirit and infuse in me true light

17
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.480
so that I may understand the truths and the good that are in these writings

18
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:28.080
and prayers. Amen. So I want to begin with June the 20th

19
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:34.560
1925 and Jesus talks to us about how we can have

20
00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.480
heaven on earth in this passage. Louisa said I felt immersed in the

21
00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:46.080
holy will of God and my sweet Jesus drawing me to himself

22
00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.760
clasped me in his arms very tightly and said my daughter

23
00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:54.880
how beautiful is the rest that the divine will has in his soul

24
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.920
when that will is there as life as distinct from just simply doing the

25
00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.040
divine will and a soul who lets my will act

26
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:12.000
and love entirely and completely. This is all relevant to our fear.

27
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.760
It's very wonderful. The Lord has just given it to us at the right moment.

28
00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:20.400
Okay, so he wants to rest in us but he needs to be there

29
00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.000
as the Lord. He needs to be there as the dominant one.

30
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.080
He needs to be able to act with love, divine love within us so he needs

31
00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.720
us given to him entirely and completely. Now notice

32
00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:40.400
there isn't a bit left for us. It's entirely and completely handed over.

33
00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:46.160
You must know he said as the soul breeds palpitates operates and everything

34
00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.640
else that takes place in her since my will is in her as the center

35
00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.600
of her life. This is the operative thing. He's looking

36
00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.760
for this that we will hand over completely to him

