00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.520
because that's when he's free to do what he needs to do

38
00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:09.840
in order to reign on the earth. So since my will is in her as the center of her

39
00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:14.080
life, it is my will that breeds in her. It's my will

40
00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:17.920
that palpitates. It's my will that gives motion to her work.

41
00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.200
It's my will that's in the circulation of her blood

42
00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:26.480
and everything else. Since this will is the same as that

