00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.760
all of heaven was shook because the same divine will that's operating in heaven

49
00:03:55.760 --> 00:04:01.680
is operating in the soul. Also he said every time our will decides

50
00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.400
to do an act, it makes new joys, new beatitudes,

51
00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:11.520
new happiness come out of us, which harmonizing

52
00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.000
everything among the divine persons, they form immense

53
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.400
seas of new happiness. Now notice everything is new.

54
00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:25.360
God is a creator. He will not patch up something. Do you remember Jesus said

