00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:08.080
beatitudes, new joy, new everything, but he wants to do that for us as well.

79
00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:12.000
Now because of this, the soul on earth understood,

80
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:16.880
who lets our will live within herself, reaches such a point

81
00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:22.480
that as she lets the divine will operate. Now notice as she lets that's the

